TI  - Quantitative detection of circulating nucleophosmin mutations DNA in the plasma  of patients with acute myeloid leukemia.
T2  - International journal of medical sciences
PY  - 2015
LA  - eng
DO  - 10.7150/ijms.10144
AN  - 25552914
