TI  - The management of hyperleukocytosis in an adult patient with acute lymphoblastic  leukemia and ataxia-telangiectasia.
T2  - Transfusion and apheresis science : official journal of the World Apheresis  Association : official journal of the European Society for Haemapheresis
PY  - 2013
