TI  - Rare CBFB-MYH11 fusion transcripts in AML with inv(16)/t(16;16) are associated  with therapy-related AML M4eo, atypical cytomorphology, atypical immunophenotype, atypical additional chromosomal rearrangements and low white blood cell count: a study on 162 patients.
