TI  - Cell lineage specific involvement in acute promyelocytic leukaemia (APL) using a  combination of May-Grunwald-Giemsa staining and fluorescence in situ hybridization techniques for the detection of the translocation t(15;17)(q22;q12).
T2  - British journal of haematology
