TI  - Analysis of prognostic factors in newly diagnosed acute promyelocytic leukemia  treated with all-trans retinoic acid and chemotherapy. Japan Adult Leukemia Study Group.
T2  - Journal of clinical oncology : official journal of the American Society of  Clinical Oncology
PY  - 1998
LA  - eng
DO  - 10.1200/JCO.1998.16.1.78
