TI  - Cytoreduction and prognosis in acute lymphoblastic leukemia--the importance of  early marrow response: report from the Childrens Cancer Group.
T2  - Journal of clinical oncology : official journal of the American Society of  Clinical Oncology
PY  - 1996
LA  - eng
DO  - 10.1200/JCO.1996.14.2.389
AN  - 8636748
