TI  - Prognostic relevance of pretreatment proliferative rapidity of marrow blast cells  in childhood acute lymphoblastic leukaemia.
T2  - British journal of cancer
PY  - 1994
LA  - eng
DO  - 10.1038/bjc.1994.473
AN  - 7981077
