TI  - Detection of acute lymphoblastic leukemia involvement in pleural fluid in an  adult patient with ataxia telangiectasia by flow cytometry method.
T2  - Indian journal of hematology & blood transfusion : an official journal of Indian  Society of Hematology and Blood Transfusion
PY  - 2014
