TI  - Splenic rupture in patients with hematologic malignancies.
T2  - Cancer
PY  - 1981
LA  - eng
DO  - 10.1002/1097-0142(19811215)48:12<2729::aid-cncr2820481229>3.0.co;2-k
AN  - 7306928
